  "ruleText": "Odb 407.03 Interim Water Supply. Temporary supplies of potable water provided under authority of RSA 146-D:6 I, shall only be available through department contractors.\n\nSource. #8491, eff 11-22-05; ss by #9935-A, eff 9-1-11, EXPIRED: 9-1-19\n\nNew. #12942, eff 12-15-19",
